   "text": "But the day-to-day relationship is much more human than that sounds. There are people on the partner team who are meeting patients and families, helping determine who needs financial support, gathering information for patient profiles, and staying with that patient through treatment. They're also working directly with hospital teams around the care itself and the cost of that care. Watsi relies on that local knowledge because we're not in the room making those decisions ourselves.",
   "timing": "words",
   "matched": 0.99,
   "lang": "en"
