   "text": "I saw what that looks like when I was in the Philippines. I visited Rowela at home after her surgery, alongside a team at World Surgical Foundation Philippines. And getting to spend time with them in that setting made that partnership feel very real to me. WSFP wasn't just the organization submitting her profile to Watsi. They were the people who knew where she was in her care, what she had been through, and what she needed next.",
   "timing": "words",
   "matched": 0.97,
   "lang": "en"
