   "text": "And sometimes the relationship matters most when things don't go exactly to plan. A patient may need care before their profile has finished fundraising, for example. In those cases, our partners can provide treatment under Watsi's guarantee that will cover the approved cost of care. Afterward, they send us an update confirming what happened, and we transfer the funds once that update has been reviewed and approved.",
