   "text": "So, when I think about a Watsi medical partnership, I don't really think about a contract or a logo on a partner page. I think about the people who are there in that community, knowing the patients, understanding the healthcare system, and staying with the work. That ongoing relationship is a huge part of what makes Watsi work.",
